クスの身長は176cm。\n\nポーズ、構図はご自由にお選びください。\n横型でお願いします。\n\nありがとうございました！💕\n\n参考文献はこちら：https://imgur.com/a/iD7VzkJ\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/iD7VzkJ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cheesekiraidayo/works/18", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7e6cecb/uploads/origins/ee085376-e26c-443a-8e74-0b584076f41a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9919afb2cc88bfae22c20c38f46a00bb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7e6cecb/uploads/origins/ee085376-e26c-443a-8e74-0b584076f41a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9919afb2cc88bfae22c20c38f46a00bb, https://si.imgix.net/a7e6cecb/uploads/origins/ee085376-e26c-443a-8e74-0b584076f41a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=217093d502503bb2d9ac2338acd1af70 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7e6cecb/uploads/origins/ee085376-e26c-443a-8e74-0b584076f41a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce369c6f895d708abd07e288c7804876 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "くまたくさん描いて～", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cheesekiraidayo/works/17", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4b5f7c95/uploads/origins/9b208099-aa18-4459-9061-e7fe9f9bd3b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03705590eda5c4d2dfa71070efaa8d45", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4b5f7c95/uploads/origins/9b208099-aa18-4459-9061-e7fe9f9bd3b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03705590eda5c4d2dfa71070efaa8d45, https://si.imgix.net/4b5f7c95/uploads/origins/9b208099-aa18-4459-9061-e7fe9f9bd3b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a7b626018fee3ae773876ce13264710 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4b5f7c95/uploads/origins/9b208099-aa18-4459-9061-e7fe9f9bd3b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress